@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Load the bundled catalogue offline
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
actor "Child singer" as actor
box "Frontend — TwinkleTune web app" #E0F2FE
  participant "repo.ts" as repo
  participant "catalog.ts" as catalog
  participant "types.ts helpers" as helpers
end box

actor -> repo : Open the songbook with no network
repo -> repo : readCache() returns null (no cache)
repo -> catalog : Read bundled songs
catalog --> repo : Six Song objects per SL-L2-3
repo -> helpers : songRange / songBeats / songSeconds per song
helpers --> repo : Range within 48-84, span <= 16, length 8..60 s
note over repo, catalog
  Catalogue invariants (SL-L2-3): six unique ids;
  non-empty phrases and syllables; ordered non-overlapping notes.
  Each song matches its SeedData twin note-for-note per SL-L2-15.
end note
repo --> actor : Six bundled songs ready to sing offline
@enduml
